    "text": "12 hours ago (UCBJ) – Tennessee Tech football is undefeated, nationally ranked and playing in a transformed Tucker Stadium, creating momentum that is reaching well beyond the scoreboard. The Golden Eagles have opened the 2026 season 3-0, building on the championship success established under Head Coach Bobby Wilder, while Tennessee Tech leadership continues to position athletics as a broader economic and community asset for Cookeville and the Upper Cumberland. Read full article",
